10	Continuing Education Provider – Gather Your Registration Information
11	
12	Before you begin your application, review the requirements for becoming an approved CE Provider.
13	
14	NOTE: Advocation Strategies, Inc. has been approved by the IRS to implement the IRS Continuing
15	Education Provider System.
16	
17	To complete your application, you must have the following:
18	
19	     Information about your organization (name, address, EIN)
20	
21	     Contact information for a primary point of contact for your organization
22	
23	     Supplemental materials
24	
25	         If you are an Accredited Educational Institution, Recognized for continuing education purposes
26	         by State licensing body or equivalent, or Approved by an IRS CE Accrediting organization.
27	
28	                      Accreditation, recognition or approval letter.
29	
30	         Any other professional organization, society or business recognized by the IRS as a provider of
31	         continuing education matters designed for enrolled agents, enrolled retirement plan agent or other
32	         tax return preparers.
33	
34	                       Program Material
35	
36	                       Program Syllabus
37	
38	                       Program Instructor Biography
39	
40	                       Program Exam (Self-Study Programs Only)
41	
42	                       Program Evaluation Form
43	
44	                       Program Certificate of Completion
45	
