59	    Information about CE programs you want to offer in the upcoming year.
60	
61	    Note: You do not have to enter all programs for the upcoming year at the time of registration, but
62	    you must submit at least one.
63	
64	    •    Program Title
65	
66	    •    Description
67	
68	    •    Target audience (e.g. EA, ERPA, OTRP)
69	
70	    •    Category (e.g. ethics, federal tax/tax related matters, etc.)
71	
72	    •    Delivery Method (e.g. in-person, self-study, online)
73	
74	    •    Number of CE hours received
75	
76	   Credit Card or bank account payment information to process your non-refundable
77	   $650.00 application fee. You may mail a paper check or money order, but your application
78	   will not be completed until the payment has been received and processed. Mailed payments may
79	   take 6-8 weeks to process.
80	
81	Note: You are not officially approved to offer programs until you receive either your 4866 Approval
82	Letter or your 4866-R Renewal Letter.
